1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,151
This man walked out of a

2
00:00:01,171 --> 00:00:03,660
maximum-security prison four times.

3
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:05,030
The guards held the door.

4
00:00:05,050 --> 00:00:05,700
First:

5
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:07,622
dressed as a workman, he tapped a police

6
00:00:07,642 --> 00:00:10,150
radio on the guards' window — and walked out.

7
00:00:10,170 --> 00:00:10,740
Second:

8
00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:13,492
posing as a judge, he phoned the jail and cut his own

9
00:00:13,512 --> 00:00:16,550
bail from $900,000 to $45,000.

10
00:00:16,570 --> 00:00:16,782
Third:

11
00:00:16,802 --> 00:00:19,340
he colored his uniform green with markers.

12
00:00:19,360 --> 00:00:20,690
The guard saw a doctor — and

13
00:00:20,710 --> 00:00:21,880
opened the front door.

14
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:22,480
Fourth:

15
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:23,899
fake medical records convinced

16
00:00:23,919 --> 00:00:25,340
the prison he was dying.

17
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:26,770
They sent him to a hospice.

18
00:00:26,790 --> 00:00:28,290
Then Texas got the news:

19
00:00:28,310 --> 00:00:29,940
Steven Russell was dead.

20
00:00:30,160 --> 00:00:30,890
He wasn't.

21
00:00:30,910 --> 00:00:32,328
Posing as a doctor, he'd checked

22
00:00:32,348 --> 00:00:34,720
himself out — and declared himself dead.

23
00:00:34,910 --> 00:00:36,060
The one mistake that caught him?

24
00:00:36,080 --> 00:00:38,390
He couldn't stay away from the man he loved.

25
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:41,250
Texas gave him 144 years.

26
00:00:41,270 --> 00:00:43,150
One hour a day outside his cell.

27
00:00:43,170 --> 00:00:43,630
Because…
